sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as Inference Client
    participant Proxy as kube-rbac-proxy<br/>(sidecar)
    participant gRPC as gRPC Server<br/>(insecure port)
    participant Logging as LoggingInterceptor
    participant Prom as PromServerInterceptor<br/>(py-grpc-prometheus)
    participant OTel as OpenTelemetry<br/>aio_server_interceptor
    participant Runtime as ML Runtime Backend<br/>(e.g. sklearn, onnx)
    participant OTLP as OTLP Collector<br/>(gRPC export)
    participant Kafka as Kafka<br/>(aiokafka)

    Note over Client,Runtime: gRPC Inference Flow (V2 Protocol)

    Client->>Proxy: gRPC ModelInfer request<br/>Auth: Bearer/ServiceAccount token
    Proxy->>Proxy: OpenShift OAuth validation
    Proxy->>gRPC: Forward authenticated request<br/>(insecure port)

    gRPC->>Logging: Intercept (non-health-check)
    Note over Logging: Skips ServerLive,<br/>ServerReady, ModelReady
    Logging->>Prom: Pass through
    Note over Prom: Record request count,<br/>latency histogram
    Prom->>OTel: Pass through
    Note over OTel: Create trace span<br/>(health-check excluded)
    OTel->>Runtime: Dispatch to loaded runtime

    Runtime->>Runtime: Execute model inference
    Runtime-->>OTel: Prediction result
    OTel-->>Prom: Response
    Prom-->>Logging: Response
    Logging-->>gRPC: Response
    gRPC-->>Proxy: Response
    Proxy-->>Client: gRPC ModelInfer response

    Note over Client,Runtime: REST Inference Flow (FastAPI)

    Client->>Proxy: REST POST /v2/models/{model}/infer<br/>Auth: Bearer token
    Proxy->>Proxy: OpenShift OAuth validation
    Proxy->>gRPC: Forward to FastAPI/uvicorn
    Note over gRPC: FastAPI handles REST<br/>via Starlette/uvicorn
    gRPC->>Runtime: Dispatch to runtime
    Runtime-->>gRPC: Prediction result
    gRPC-->>Proxy: JSON response
    Proxy-->>Client: HTTP response

    Note over Client,Runtime: Streaming Inference Flow

    Client->>Proxy: gRPC ModelStreamInfer<br/>(bidirectional stream)
    Proxy->>gRPC: Forward stream
    gRPC->>Runtime: Stream requests
    Runtime-->>gRPC: Stream responses
    gRPC-->>Proxy: Stream responses
    Proxy-->>Client: Streamed results

    Note over OTel,OTLP: Async Telemetry Export
    OTel--)OTLP: Export traces<br/>(OTLP gRPC protocol)
    Prom--)Prom: Expose /metrics endpoint

    Note over Runtime,Kafka: Optional Async Messaging
    Runtime--)Kafka: Publish inference events<br/>(aiokafka async producer)
